# TaskFlow - Collaborative Project Management Platform

A full-stack project management application built with modern web technologies. Manage workspaces, projects, tasks, and collaborate with team members in real-time.

## 📋 Features

- **User Authentication**: JWT-based secure authentication with refresh tokens
- **Workspace Management**: Create and manage multiple workspaces with role-based access control
- **Projects & Tasks**: Organize work into projects and tasks with detailed tracking
- **Real-time Updates**: Socket.IO integration for live board updates and notifications
- **Task Management**: Track task status, priority, assignees, and labels
- **Comments & Discussion**: Threaded comments on tasks for team collaboration
- **Responsive Design**: Full desktop and mobile support with Tailwind CSS

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

### Backend
- **Node.js** + **TypeScript**
- **Express.js** - Web framework
- **PostgreSQL** + **Prisma ORM** - Database
- **JWT** - Authentication
- **Socket.IO** - Real-time communication
- **Zod** - Schema validation

### Frontend
- **React** 18 + **TypeScript**
- **Vite** - Build tool
- **Tailwind CSS** - Styling
- **React Router** - Navigation
- **React Query** - Data fetching & caching
- **Zustand** - State management
- **Socket.IO Client** - Real-time updates

### DevOps
- **Docker** & **Docker Compose**
- **GitHub Actions** - CI/CD
- **Prisma** - Database migrations

## 🚀 Quick Start

### Prerequisites

- Node.js 18+ and npm
- Docker and Docker Compose (optional, for containerized setup)
- PostgreSQL 16+ (if running locally without Docker)

